    <title>Kasus 2: Permainan Hot Potato</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #e0e0e0;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
